<title>SINGAPORE: IPC Corp incorporates subsidiary.</title>
<headline>IPC Corp incorporates subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Personal computer maker IPC Corp said on Monday it has incorporated a wholly-owned marketing and distribution subsidiary called Austin Federation (S) Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement Austin has an authorised share capital of Singapore 100,000 and an issued and paid-up capital of S$100,000.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
